    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">This app reads information about the apps installed on your device (name, package name, version, install date, size, usage and declared permissions) and displays it on screen.\n\nThat information, together with any tags and notes you create, is stored only in a database on this device.\n\nThe app does not declare the internet permission (android.permission.INTERNET), so it is technically incapable of sending anything off the device. It contains no advertising or analytics SDKs.</string>
